{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders, comparing to the previous concat fusion baseline (llm_summary_009). Validation accuracy of 0.7062 (vs 0.7150) and F1 of 0.6671 (vs 0.6872) suggest weighted fusion may not improve performance compared to concatenation, though the difference is small. The role of fusion strategy in multimodal integration and its interaction with encoder complexity remain uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

